  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ALINIHA Self-Managed Association of Kobokoro(Association ALINIHA Autogre de Kobokoro)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will enable Kobokoro to improve its production output and marketing capacity by developing two large diameter wells at each of the sites, acquisition of simple tools and transport equipment, and technical assistance and training in financial and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
